$grp PS_MissionDescription : "{3136BE42592F3B1B}PrefabsEditable/MissionDescription/EditableMissionDescription.et" {
 Overview {
  coords 3291.947 47.151 2221.159
  m_sTitle "Overview"
  m_sTextData "An M1A1 armor section, CAAT section, and FO team with an M777 element conduct a violent route clearance two miles north along the ASR, secured by rolling waves of infantry."\
  ""\
  "Mission is dedicated to Darkside6 whom wanted a M777 mission"\
  ""\
  "<h2>Notes</h2>"\
  "• Tank Section CO is in overall command. FO required for fire support."\
  ""\
  ""
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
 }
 MissionNotes {
  coords 3291.92 46.64 2209.38
  m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
  m_sTextData "Mission by jubxxxjub"\
  ""\
  "AO limit in effect but in order to not kill the M777 crew, I disabled the countdown penalty. GMs don't let the players leave the AO!"\
  ""\
  "JIP TP"\
  ""\
  "End conditions:"\
  ""\
  "80 Minutes pass: Timelimit reached thus mission failed."\
  ""\
  "80% US player causalties: Defeat"\
  ""\
  "80% US players reach endstate and hold for 10min: Victory"
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 9
 }
 "I.Situation" {
  coords 3277.077 50.22 2207.697
  m_sTitle "I. Situation"
  m_sTextData "The year is 2009. The country of Takistan has been invaded by coalition forces."\
  ""\
  "You are a part of a combined US/UK task force."\
  ""\
  "Our MEU (Marine Expeditionary Unit) has thrust into Takistan and has been traveling down this ASR (Alternate Supply Route), moving north toward Rasman. The Takistani resistance has been moderate thus far due to low-quality reservists and unmotivated regulars. "\
  ""\
  "ISR has informed us that the TKA  is rallying and fortifying due to the arrival of the Republican Guard to our AO. The MAGTF (Marine Air-Ground Task Force) HQ has a timetable to reach, and their intent is to roll through them within 80min."
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
 }
 "II.FriendlyForces" {
  coords 3270.781 52.021 2208.541
  m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
  m_sTextData "1x USMC Rifle Company(AI), the first platoon releases 5min, the second in 15min, the third in 30min on mission start."\
  "	Each rifle platoon is full strength, and is tasked with securing the settlments. Their SPs are our own SP, so take into account TKA stragglers and travel time."\
  ""\
  "x1 M1A1 TUSK Section "\
  ""\
  "1x USMC CAAT with x1 MK19 M1151, x1 M2HB M1151, and x1 TOW carrier"\
  ""\
  "x1 FO team with M2HB CROWs M1151 for long range observation and engagement."\
  ""\
  "Note: TL is the Vic CO, the rifleman are drivers and gunners respectively."\
  "<h3>TOW GUNNERS</h3> <i>LOWER</I> YOUR PANELS, LEST YE WISH TO PERISH"\
  ""\
  "x2 M777 they are located at a FB to the South East and are available for firemissions per the FDC."\
  ""\
  "They have unlimited smoke/charges and 122rnds HE or AB-HE each gun."\
  ""
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 1
 }
 "III.EnemyForces" {
  coords 3267.547 51.84 2202.581
  m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
  m_sTextData "x1 mixed Company of TKA forces comprised of reservists, regulars, and republican guards."\
  ""\
  "ISR indicates there are entrenched vehicles comprised of BTR70s, BMP2s, T72s. Nearby there are BRDM scouts to the East at Garmsar."\
  ""\
  "UK forces to the West have suggested that the main body of republican guards are engaged with them but expect additional QRFs to flex from Bastam."\
  ""\
  "To the North in the Par-e Siah oil field there is a tank company. USAF fixed wing and US Army AH-64s have decimated them but higher hasn't recieved a clear BDA. Expect some stragglers to attempt to link up with the forces in our AO as well."\
  ""\
  "Their weapons include AKs, M16s, FN-FALs, G3s, SVDs, RPKs, PKMs, RPGs."\
  ""\
  "The reservists and regulars wear OD soviet style uniforms, The guards have body armor and wear Cuban lizard BDUs."
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 2
 }
 "IV.Mission" {
  coords 3264.814 53.251 2206.532
  m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
  m_sTextData "Primary task: move to the town of Imarat and hold it for 10 min to allow for follow on forces of the main body to arrive. "\
  ""\
  "Secondary Task: Support the rifle company up the ASR and destroy any threats to them and follow on forces."
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 3
 }
 "V.Sustainment" {
  coords 3266.036 53.313 2208.564
  m_sTitle "V. Sustainment"
  m_sTextData "None"
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 4
 }
 "VI.Comsig" {
  coords 3266.104 53.436 2209.668
  m_sTitle "VI. Comsig"
  m_sTextData "AO Freq: 48Mhz"\
  "Fire support: 47.9"\
  "Tank Section net: 42Mhz"\
  ""\
  "Intersquad COM: preset"\
  ""\
  "Callsigns: "\
  "Tank1(CO) - 9'1"\
  "Tank2 - 9'2"\
  "CAAT - 3'1"\
  "M777 - 6'7"\
  "FO - 10'8"
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 5
 }
 ArtyNotes {
  coords 3291.92 46.64 2209.38
  m_sTitle "M777 Notes"
  m_sTextData "Taken from Blue's mission"\
  "To use the M777:"\
  ""\
  "1. Find out charges and elevation from the ballistic manual."\
  ""\
  "2. Before loading, make sure the gun elevation is below 800, the loading tray is raised, and the breech is open."\
  ""\
  "3. Take a shell from the crate, place it onto the tray, then lower the tray and ram the shell. Raise the tray."\
  ""\
  "4. Take propellant from the crate, look at the breech and load it. Then close the breech."\
  ""\
  "5. On the left side of the howitzer, start aiming (interact, then right click to enter the view). Adjust azimuth and elevation to the target."\
  ""\
  "6. On the right side, fire when ready."\
  ""\
  ""\
  "Other notes:"\
  "- All of the described steps are interactions on the gun. Some might be a bit hard to spot initially."\
  "- Make sure to take an artillery ballistic manual from the crate, the one in your inventory is for mortars."\
  "- If you are doing step 3 for the first time, you may have to slightly move the elevation to be able to place the shell onto the tray."\
  "-There are x3 manpack radios around the FB, feel free to grab one."
  m_bEmptyFactionVisibility 1
  m_bShowForAnyFaction 1
  m_iOrder 10
 }
}